      <activity id="766df7bd-254d-513e-9d13-914e6f4a31b2" activityNameId="19bb9bf1-51f6-5f30-a9ff-7a8d6e164c1f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium, production mix for aluminium profiles, SZFF 2014, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium, production mix for aluminium profiles, SZFF 2014, at plant
The shares of primary and secondary aluminium used in the production of aluminium profiles are based on a survey among the producers supplying the Swiss market. The share of secondary aluminium was further separated into old (product) and new (process) scrap based on data from a European mass flow model for wrought alloy in 2013.;
UUID: e2946dda-3cf3-30a3-9f54-98950af699ab
This dataset includes the mix of primary aluminium and secondary aluminium from old and new scrap used in the production of aluminium profiles in Switzerland in 2014.
Location: Europe
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 27100000
Sampling: Aluminium industry survey 
Extrapolations: Secondary aluminium separated into old and new scrap based on data from a European mass flow model for aluminium wrought alloy in 2013.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2946dda-3cf3-30a3-9f54-98950af699ab.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
